      "comment": "FEVER HIGH (1) jumps from the inside draw. Last start finished 3rd on November 19 over 300m at this track behind Turn Back Prime beaten 4.5 lengths (17.77) in a Maiden. Can find winning form. DEVIL DISGUISE (2) shows ability but remains a maiden after 13 starts. Is better than last start when out of the placings, finishing fourth (17.91) at this track. Can figure in the finish. PACKHAM TIME (8) settled well back early on debut and always towards the tail to finish seventh (18.00) at this track over 300m. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. FERGIE'S FLYER (4) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can atone.",
